          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Reach {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} for bespoke aromatherapy blends, safe guidance, and retail add-ons.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    /* Layout family: lux_gallery | Voice: mystic_modern */\\n    :root{--bg:#0f1720;--card:#0f1a26;--muted:#9aa8b3;--accent:#a3ffef;--accent-2:#8ec5ff;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);--radius:14px;--maxw:1100px}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(2,6,23,1) 0%, rgba(5,14,26,1) 70%);font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial;color:#e6f7f6}\\n    /* SVG pattern fallback */\\n    body::before{content:'';position:fixed;inset:0;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-size:480px;background-repeat:repeat;opacity:0.06;mix-blend-mode:screen;pointer-events:none}\\n    header{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:32px auto;padding:20px 28px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;flex-direction:column}\\n    .brand h1{font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.2px;margin:0;font-size:18px}\\n    .brand p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    nav{margin-left:auto}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-size:14px}\\n    nav a.primary{color:var(--bg);background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:600}\\n\\n    main{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:18px auto;padding:36px;border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), transparent);box-shadow:0 8px 40px rgba(2,6,23,0.6)}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:28px}\\n\\n    /* Hero */\\n    .hero{padding:28px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(163,255,239,0.04), rgba(142,197,255,0.02));backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}\\n    .kicker{color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;font-size:12px;display:inline-block;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(163,255,239,0.04)}\\n    .title{font-size:28px;margin:12px 0 6px}\\n    .lede{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px}\\n\\n    /* diagnostic */\\n    .card{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .diag h3{margin:0 0 8px}\\n    .diag p{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px}\\n    .faq dt{font-weight:600;margin-top:12px}\\n    .faq dd{margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n\\n    /* plan */\\n    .plan-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:12px}\\n    .plan-item{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}\\n    .badge{min-width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#032;}\\n    .plan-meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n\\n    /* micro habits */\\n    .habits{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:12px}\\n    .habit{background:var(--glass);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    /* pricing (retail_addon) */\\n    .pricing{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:12px}\\n    .price-card{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(163,255,239,0.02), rgba(142,197,255,0.02))}\\n    .price-card small{color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    /* CTA */\\n    .cta{margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:12px}\\n    .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#002;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(142,197,255,0.08);text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    .ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:var(--muted);padding:10px 12px;border-radius:12px}\\n\\n    /* aside / form */\\n    aside{position:relative}\\n    .contact-box{position:sticky;top:28px;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));}\\n    label{display:block;font-size:13px;margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    input[type=text],input[type=email],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;margin-top:6px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:transparent;color:#eafefb}\\n    textarea{min-height:110px}\\n    .muted{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\\n\\n    footer{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:28px auto;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;padding:18px}\\n    @media(max-width:880px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.habits{grid-template-columns:1fr}.contact-box{position:static;margin-top:18px}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n      <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n      <p>{{TAGLINE}}</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Root</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Offerings</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"blends.html\\\">Blends</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"shop.html\\\">Store</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Tariffs</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Story</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Reserve</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\" class=\\\"primary\\\">Connect</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n      <section>\\n        <!-- HERO -->\\n        <div class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"kicker\\\">Reach Out</span>\\n          <h2 class=\\\"title\\\">Find your scent language — speak with {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"lede\\\">A calm, safety-first consultation to explore aroma preferences, sensitivity, and lifestyle so retail blends and add-ons feel crafted just for you.</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"cta\\\">\\n            <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n            <a class=\\\"ghost\\\" href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">Email a note</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- DIAGNOSTIC -->\\n        <div class=\\\"card diag\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n          <h3>Pre-visit snapshot</h3>\\n          <p>Answering a few gentle questions helps me craft blends that align with safety and your personal scent story. I will not provide medical diagnoses — only aromatic support and retail guidance.</p>\\n          <dl class=\\\"faq\\\">\\n            <dt>How long is a consult?</dt>\\n            <dd>Typically 30–45 minutes. We discuss goals, sensitivities, and preferences.</dd>\\n            <dt>Allergies & patch tests?</dt>\\n            <dd>Always recommended. I’ll guide you through a safe dilution & patch test protocol before using new topical blends.</dd>\\n            <dt>Pets & pregnancy?</dt>\\n            <dd>Special precautions apply. I will offer pet-safe suggestions and pregnancy-safe options when relevant.</dd>\\n          </dl>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- PLAN -->\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n          <h3>How we’ll proceed</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"plan-list\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"plan-item\\\"><div class=\\\"badge\\\">1</div><div><strong>Listen</strong><div class=\\\"plan-meta\\\">Share lifestyle, scent memories, and any sensitivities.</div></div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"plan-item\\\"><div class=\\\"badge\\\">2</div><div><strong>Design</strong><div class=\\\"plan-meta\\\">I propose safe single-note tests and a curated retail add-on plan.</div></div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"plan-item\\\"><div class=\\\"badge\\\">3</div><div><strong>Apply</strong><div class=\\\"plan-meta\\\">Try diluted roll-ons, a diffuser blend, or a small kit with clear usage notes.</div></div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"plan-item\\\"><div class=\\\"badge\\\">4</div><div><strong>Adjust</strong><div class=\\\"plan-meta\\\">We iterate gently to ensure comfort and desired aroma profile.</div></div></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- MICRO_HABITS -->\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n          <h3>Small rituals to begin</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"habits\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"habit\\\"><strong>Morning inhale</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">2–3 mindful breaths from a personal inhaler or diffuser for a gentle mood reset.</div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"habit\\\"><strong>Patch test routine</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Try a 0.5–1% dilution on forearm for 24 hours—no itching or redness before topical use.</div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"habit\\\"><strong>Diffuser etiquette</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Diffuse in short bursts (10–30 minutes) and ventilate the space; keep pets and people with sensitivities in mind.</div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"habit\\\"><strong>Storage</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Keep blends cool, dark, and capped to preserve aroma and efficacy.</div></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- PRICING (retail_addon) -->\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n          <h3>Retail add-ons</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Carefully curated roll-ons, sample kits, and diffusible blends. Prices below are indicative; consult for a bespoke pack.</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"pricing\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"price-card\\\"><div><strong>Starter Sample Kit</strong><div><small>3x 2ml aroma trials</small></div></div><div><strong>$24</strong></div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"price-card\\\"><div><strong>Personal Roll-On</strong><div><small>10ml diluted aroma, labeled</small></div></div><div><strong>$28</strong></div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"price-card\\\"><div><strong>Diffuser Blend</strong><div><small>30ml for home diffusion</small></div></div><div><strong>$36</strong></div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">All retail items include clear dilution & safety instructions. Consult before using near children, pregnant people, or pets.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- CTA -->\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3>Ready to connect?</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Choose a short discovery message or schedule a full consult. I’ll respond within 48 hours on weekdays.</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"cta\\\">\\n            <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Book a discovery</a>\\n            <a class=\\\"ghost\\\" href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">Send a quick note</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class=\\\"contact-box card\\\">\\n          <h3>Contact form</h3>\\n          <form method=\\\"post\\\" action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" onsubmit=\\\"return validateForm(this)\\\">\\n            <label for=\\\"name\\\">Your name</label>\\n            <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your full name\\\" required>\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n            <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@example.com\\\" required>\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone (optional)</label>\\n            <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{PHONE}}\\\">\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"reason\\\">How can I help?</label>\\n            <select id=\\\"reason\\\" name=\\\"reason\\\">\\n              <option>Consult / custom blend</option>\\n              <option>Retail product inquiry</option>\\n              <option>Patch test question</option>\\n              <option>Booking & scheduling</option>\\n            </select>\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"message\\\">A brief note</label>\\n            <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Tell me about sensitivities, pets, pregnancy, or scent likes...\\\"></textarea>\\n\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n              <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send message</button>\\n              <a class=\\\"ghost\\\" href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">Call {{PHONE}}</a>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <p class=\\\"muted\\\">By contacting me you acknowledge this is aromatic guidance and not medical treatment. If you have health concerns, consult a licensed practitioner.</p>\\n          </form>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <h4>Studio</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Located in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — appointment only. For urgent matters, call {{PHONE}} or email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent)\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>\\n          <svg width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"80\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 200 80\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"none\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px;border-radius:8px;display:block;overflow:hidden\\\">\\n            <defs>\\n              <linearGradient id=\\\"g\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#a3ffef\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.2\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#8ec5ff\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.12\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n            </defs>\\n            <rect width=\\\"200\\\" height=\\\"80\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g)\\\"></rect>\\n            <g fill=\\\"rgba(2,6,23,0.04)\\\">\\n              <circle cx=\\\"30\\\" cy=\\\"20\\\" r=\\\"10\\\"></circle>\\n              <circle cx=\\\"70\\\" cy=\\\"50\\\" r=\\\"18\\\"></circle>\\n              <circle cx=\\\"140\\\" cy=\\\"30\\\" r=\\\"12\\\"></circle>\\n            </g>\\n          </svg>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer>\\n    <div style=\\\"max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n      <div>&copy; <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong> — crafted with care | {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Questions? <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent)\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • {{PHONE}}</div>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    function validateForm(form){\\n      var email = form.email.value||''; if(!email.includes('@')){alert('Please enter a valid email.');return false}\\n      // safety-first acknowledgement\\n      var msg = form.message.value.toLowerCase(); if(msg.includes('medical') || msg.includes('diagnose')){\\n        if(!confirm('I do not offer medical diagnoses. Do you want to continue sending this message?')) return false;\\n      }\\n      return true;\\n    }\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"This chunk (slug: aromatherapy-2026-02-16T17-05-00-388Z-026) includes two files for the contact page of a mystic_modern aromatherapy site (layoutFamily: lux_gallery, offerModel: retail_addon).\\n\\nFiles included:\\n- contact.html — Full contact page containing the required sections in this pack: hero, diagnostic, plan, micro_habits, pricing, cta. Uses placeholders for site variables: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}, {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{FAVORITE_BLEND}}.\\n\\n  Notes:\\n  - Safety-first language is present (no medical claims). FAQs cover dilution, patch test, pets, and pregnancy guidance.\\n  - The layout uses only CSS and inline SVG for visual richness; it references assets/img/pattern.svg as a decorative background (ensure that file is provided elsewhere in the bundle).\\n  - Form posts to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} and includes minimal client validation and a safety confirmation when certain keywords are present.\\n\\n- README.md — This file (you are reading it).\\n\\nUsage:\\n- Place these files into the site root. Ensure the rest of the site pages (index.html, services.html, blends.html, shop.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html) and the asset SVG (assets/img/pattern.svg) are present in other chunks.\\n- Replace placeholders with actual business values during build or templating.\\n\\nAccessibility & safety:\\n- Simple semantic structure, clear labels, and conservative aromatherapy guidance. No medical treatment claims.\\n\\nDesign intent:\\n- Mystic modern voice with a luxurious gallery aesthetic. Visuals rely on gradients, subtle SVG shapes, and a repeating pattern SVG.\\n\\nIf you are assembling the full site, ensure the unique SVG pattern is included at assets/img/pattern.svg and that other pages vary headings and section ordering to meet uniqueness requirements.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
